.disk
0 block 8 type
1 block c@ .
5 wipe
0 >line \ arithmetic helpers
1 >line : sq ( n -- n*n ) dup * ;
2 >line : cube ( n -- n^3 ) dup sq * ;  \ ends at the line's end
3 >line 3 cube .
5 list
5 load 4 sq .
6 wipe
0 >line \ a second screen
1 >line : twice ( n -- 2n ) 2 * ;
5 6 index
5 6 thru 21 twice .
7 wipe
0 >line \ an error on line 2
2 >line 1 2 nosuchword 3
7 load
.s
8 wipe
0 >line \ nested load
1 >line 5 load 10 cube .
8 load
0 block drop update
2000 block
16 >line too far
save-buffers
